Package: aphantasiaWMStrats
Title: Data Analysis for a Working Memory Strategies Study on Aphantasia
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Maël", "Delem", , "mael.delem@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8518-1991"))
    )
Description: This package contains the data and code
    to reproduce the analyses associated with an online study on a
    complex working memory task investigating non-visual working
    memory strategies in aphantasia.
